            "透露自己的政治盘算"
          ],
          "rounds_limit": 5,
          "fallback_lines": [
            "这话不必当此说。",
            "在下不便议论。",
            "此事容后再议。"
          ]
        }
      },
      "next": "xunyu_farewell"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "xunyu_farewell",
      "type": "narration",
      "lines": [
        { "type": "narration", "text": "无论对话如何走向，5 轮后荀彧拱手告辞。" },
        { "type": "dialogue", "speaker": "荀彧", "stage_direction": "走到门口，又回头", "text": "……对了。" },
        { "type": "dialogue", "speaker": "荀彧", "text": "阁下若想离开洛阳，往西去长安的路，现在还能走。再过两个月，就走不了了。" },
        { "type": "narration", "text": "他出门，消失在晨雾里。" }
      ],
      "next": "back_upstairs"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "back_upstairs",
      "type": "narration_with_choice",
      "lines": [
        { "type": "narration", "text": "主角回到楼上。阿萤正握刀守在门口，看见他进来才松了口气。" },
        { "type": "dialogue", "speaker": "阿萤", "text": "……是谁？" },
        { "type": "dialogue", "speaker": "主角", "text": "……一个该感谢的人。" },
        { "type": "dialogue", "speaker": "阿萤", "text": "他要做什么？" },
        { "type": "dialogue", "speaker": "主角", "text": "他要我们走。" },
        { "type": "dialogue", "speaker": "阿萤", "text": "去哪儿？" },
        { "type": "dialogue", "speaker": "主角", "text": "长安。" },
        { "type": "narration", "text": "阿萤沉默了很久。" },
        { "type": "dialogue", "speaker": "阿萤", "text": "……可我们刚到。" },
        { "type": "dialogue", "speaker": "主角", "text": "是。可洛阳要塌了。" },
        { "type": "narration", "text": "窗外，天色正在亮起来。远远地，宫城方向传来一声钟响——那是早朝的钟。一声，又一声。" },
        { "type": "narration", "text": "钟声里，主角忽然听见自己心跳得很快。他知道这是他这辈子第一次，握住了一个能改变命运的东西——不是他的命运，是别人的命运。" },
        { "type": "narration", "text": "他低头看了看手里那份卷得发黄的文书。然后看了看阿萤。" }
      ],
      "choices": [
        { "id": "go_changan",  "text": "听荀彧的话，立刻动身去长安",   "next": "chapter_end" },
        { "id": "stay_send",   "text": "留在洛阳，把文书送出去",       "next": "branch_stay_send",   "pending": true },
        { "id": "burn_doc",    "text": "烧掉文书，留在洛阳从底层做起", "next": "branch_burn_doc",    "pending": true },
        { "id": "give_ayinghuo","text": "把文书交给阿萤保管，自己去找荀彧","next": "branch_give_ayinghuo","pending": true }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "chapter_end",
      "type": "chapter_end",
      "lines": [
        { "type": "narration", "display_style": "fullscreen_subtitle", "text": "中平六年八月。" },
        { "type": "narration", "display_style": "fullscreen_subtitle", "text": "这一年，灵帝驾崩。" },
        { "type": "narration", "display_style": "fullscreen_subtitle", "text": "这一年，何进召董卓入京。" },
        { "type": "narration", "display_style": "fullscreen_subtitle", "text": "这一年，十常侍把少帝劫出皇宫，又被人追上。" },
        { "type": "narration", "display_style": "fullscreen_subtitle", "text": "这一年，洛阳的火，烧了不止一回。" },
        { "type": "narration", "display_style": "fullscreen_subtitle", "text": "史书上记着这些。" },
        { "type": "narration", "display_style": "fullscreen_subtitle", "text": "没有记着的，是一个叫阿萤的姑娘，在洛阳的客栈里，第一次说她想死。" },
        { "type": "narration", "display_style": "fullscreen_subtitle", "text": "没有记着的，是一个背着笔的少年，在一份发黄的文书前，做了他一生中第一个真正意义上的选择。" },
        { "type": "narration", "display_style": "fullscreen_subtitle", "text": "史书不记这些。" },
        { "type": "narration", "display_style": "fullscreen_subtitle", "text": "但你记着。" }
      ],
      "next_chapter": "03_changan"
    }
  ]
}
